{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RiFY4uDoH91794839942.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>房委會轄下停車場，明年元旦起上調收費。</p><p></p><p>房委會商業樓宇小組委員會通過輕微上調房委會轄下停車場收費，其中露天及有蓋泊車位，按車種月租收費加50元至200元，私家車、輕型貨車及電單車，泊車時租收費上調1元，而私家車「日泊」和「24小時泊」收費，則分別上調10元及15元。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.PARKING-2000_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026lzp14bh8L01794839962.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>房委會指自上次檢討以來，市場上同類停車場，月租收費普遍有所上升，調整收費使收費貼近市場收費水平，並維持房委會財政穩健。另外亦通過為合適的停車場，設立月租使用者，專用「充電共享區」，惠及更多電動車使用者。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T16:00:10.489847+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":235,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T12:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T23:14:50.826216+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T15:53:31.326798+00:00","content_hash":"892263e38595bc930da44b91d17e07474cac81ea41e2c0c13732bc21712f6774","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T16:00:10.489847+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}